# torstack torrc — GENERATED, jangan edit manual!
# sumber: conf/torrc.example — di-render otomatis oleh `bin/torstack start`
# atau `bun bootstrap.mjs`. Placeholder ROOT diganti dengan path repo.
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050
ControlPort 127.0.0.1:9051
CookieAuthentication 1
CookieAuthFile {{ROOT}}/state/tor-data/control_auth_cookie
DataDirectory {{ROOT}}/state/tor-data
Log notice file {{ROOT}}/logs/tor.log
RunAsDaemon 0
AvoidDiskWrites 1
CircuitBuildTimeout 10
LearnCircuitBuildTimeout 0
MaxCircuitDirtiness 300
NewCircuitPeriod 15
